          "text": "Created `.github/workflows/build-and-deploy.yml`.\n\nKey points:\n- `build` uploads with `actions/upload-artifact@v4` (name `build-output`, `dist/`).\n- `deploy` declares `needs: build` so it runs after and only if build succeeds.\n- `actions/download-artifact@v4` with the same `name` pulls it from the **same run's** artifacts (`path: dist`).\n\nArtifacts are scoped to the run, so no run ID is needed — matching `name` within the same run is sufficient. If multiple runs could interfere, that isn't possible here since download defaults to `github.run_id`.",
